      "proposedDefault": "Creation and redirects are open (no account), with rate limiting on creation only. Each link gets an unguessable management token (at least 128 bits) returned once at creation; only its SHA-256 hash is stored; reading statistics requires it as a Bearer token. A lost token cannot be recovered or reset. (Reviewer-directed.)",
