"},{"path":"docs/design.md","action":"create","content":"# URL Shortener: Design

Base package `com.agentic.shortener`. The contract is `src/main/resources/openapi/api.yaml`.

## Shared files (owned by DESIGN; implementers must not edit them)
- `config.AppConfig`: `@EnableScheduling`, `@EnableConfigurationProperties`, `Clock clock()` (system UTC).
- `config.ShortenerProperties`: record bound to `shortener.*`, with defaults in code. Tests change values with `@TestPropertySource`, e.g. `shortener.rate-limit.creations-per-window=3`.
- `common.ErrorCode`, `common.ErrorBody(code, message)`, `common.ApiException(ErrorCode, String)`, `common.RateLimitExceededException(long retryAfterSeconds)` and `common.GlobalExceptionHandler`.
- Bean-validation field errors map to codes: `url` gives INVALID_URL, `alias` gives INVALID_ALIAS, `expiresAt` gives INVALID_EXPIRY. Malformed JSON gives INVALID_REQUEST.
- `pom.xml` adds micrometer-registry-prometheus. `application.yml` sets the Redis timeouts to 50 ms, enables Flyway and uses ddl-auto=validate.

## Contracts
- `api`: `CreateLinkRequest`, `CreateLinkResponse`, `StatsResponse`, `DailyCount`, `ReferrerCount`.
- `api` services: `LinkCreationService`, `RedirectService`, `StatsService`, `TokenService`, `UrlSafetyValidator`, `CreationRateLimiter`, `ClickRetentionService`.
- `domain`: `Link`, `Click` (`Click.DIRECT = "(direct)"`), `LinkRepository`, `ClickRepository`, plus the projections `DailyClickTotal` and `ReferrerClickTotal`.
- `domain.port` (the ports): `HostResolver`, `LinkCache`, `CachedLink`, `ClickRecorder`, `ClickEvent`, `ClickBatchWriter`.

## Data model (IMPL-SCHEMA must create exactly this)
Table `links`:
- `id BIGINT GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY`
- `code VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL UNIQUE`
- `long_url VARCHAR(2048) NOT NULL`
- `token_hash VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL` (lower-case hex SHA-256)
- `created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE NOT NULL`
- `expires_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE NULL`
- index on `expires_at`

Table `click_counts`:
- `id BIGINT GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY`
- `link_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES links(id)`
- `click_day DATE NOT NULL`
- `referrer_host VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL` (`(direct)` when there is no referrer)
- `click_count BIGINT NOT NULL`
- `UNIQUE (link_id, click_day, referrer_host)`

There is no IP, user agent, URL path or timestamp column. The columns avoid the H2 keywords DAY and COUNT.

## Implementation tasks, package ownership and classes
All classes are Spring `@Component`, `@Service` or `@RestController` beans with constructor injection, using exactly these constructor parameters.

IMPL-SCHEMA owns `src/main/resources/db/migration/`:
- `V1__create_links_and_clicks.sql`: portable SQL that runs on both H2 and PostgreSQL.

IMPL-SAFETY owns `com.agentic.shortener.safety`:
- `DefaultUrlSafetyValidator(HostResolver resolver, ShortenerProperties props)` implements UrlSafetyValidator.
  - Requires an absolute http or https URI with a host. Anything else, including a URL over 2048 characters, gives INVALID_URL.
  - Parses IPv4 literals itself, including decimal, hex, octal and short dotted forms (`2130706433`, `0x7f.1`, `0177.0.0.1`), and IPv6 literals. Literals do not call the resolver.
  - Calls `resolver.resolve(host)` exactly once for a hostname. An UnknownHostException gives UNSAFE_URL.
  - Rejects with UNSAFE_URL if any address is loopback, private (10/8, 172.16/12, 192.168/16), link-local (169.254/16, fe80::/10), CGNAT (100.64/10), unspecified (0.0.0.0/8, ::), unique-local (fc00::/7) or multicast. IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses are checked as IPv4.
- `InetAddressHostResolver(ShortenerProperties props)` implements HostResolver. It wraps `InetAddress.getAllByName` with a `resolver.timeout` limit.

IMPL-LINK owns `com.agentic.shortener.link`:
- `SecureTokenService()` implements TokenService. It uses 32 random bytes from SecureRandom, Base64url-encoded without padding, and `MessageDigest.isEqual` for comparison.
- `DefaultLinkCreationService(LinkRepository links, UrlSafetyValidator validator, TokenService tokens, ShortenerProperties props, Clock clock)`:
  - Validates in this order: URL first, then the alias (reserved names, compared case-insensitively, give INVALID_ALIAS; an existing code gives ALIAS_TAKEN).
  - Parses `expiresAt` with `OffsetDateTime.parse`, then converts it to an Instant. It must be after now and at most now plus maxExpiry, otherwise INVALID_EXPIRY.
  - Generated codes are 7 base62 characters from SecureRandom, retried up to maxCodeAttempts times.
  - `shortUrl` is baseUrl + "/" + code.
- `DefaultRedirectService(LinkRepository links, LinkCache cache, ClickRecorder clicks, Clock clock)`:
  - Tries the cache first and catches every cache exception as a miss, logged at WARN.
  - On a database hit it puts the CachedLink into the cache; put failures are caught too.
  - Checks expiry against the Clock every time, including for cached entries: a missing link gives NOT_FOUND and an expired one gives GONE.
  - Calls `clicks.record(code, referer)` only on success, wrapped in try/catch.
- `LinkController(LinkCreationService service, CreationRateLimiter limiter)`: `POST /api/links` with a `@Valid` body. It calls `limiter.acquire(request)` first and returns 201.
- `Redirect

